00:12:31.182 --> 00:12:34.286
and just move to Bob's Big Boy.

00:12:34.286 --> 00:12:36.354
-Right.
[ Laughter ]

00:12:36.354 --> 00:12:39.124
That's where my grandma,
Auntie Pete Seeger, lives.

00:12:39.124 --> 00:12:40.792
[ Laughter ]
-[ Gasps ]

00:12:40.792 --> 00:12:42.727
-Grandma Auntie lives
at Bob's Big Boy, yeah.

00:12:42.727 --> 00:12:44.963
-Oh, my God.
-Yeah.

00:12:44.963 --> 00:12:47.366
-I should...
[ Laughter ]

00:12:47.366 --> 00:12:51.136
I should've washed my hair.
-Yeah. Right.

00:12:51.136 --> 00:12:53.272
[ Laughter ]

00:12:53.272 --> 00:12:56.809
-Well -- Well, how about you,
Popeye?

00:12:56.809 --> 00:12:59.211
What do you do for a living?

00:12:59.211 --> 00:13:01.680
-I'm a very successful
astronaut.

00:13:01.680 --> 00:13:02.948
-Oh.
[ Laughter ]

00:13:02.948 --> 00:13:06.618
-But my real passion is digging.
[ Laughter ]

00:13:06.618 --> 00:13:09.588
Give me a spoon, and
put me out in the backyard.

00:13:09.588 --> 00:13:13.224
-My God.
Why, Popeye,

00:13:13.224 --> 00:13:14.993
that's my
favorite activity, too.

00:13:14.993 --> 00:13:17.463
-Well, what do you like to do
for fun?

00:13:17.463 --> 00:13:21.233
-I just said I like digging.
-Yeah, I was listening, yeah.

00:13:21.233 --> 00:13:22.868
-Well, I, um...
-What else?

00:13:22.868 --> 00:13:25.004
-I enjoy collecting bikinis.
-Oh, yeah?

00:13:25.004 --> 00:13:27.105
-I think you know
what that means.

00:13:27.105 --> 00:13:30.543
And taking long walks to France.
-Is that right?

00:13:30.543 --> 00:13:32.477
It's a lot of steps
on your Fitbit.

00:13:32.477 --> 00:13:33.946
Uh...
[ Laughter ]

00:13:33.946 --> 00:13:38.517
Listen, Pinto, there's something
I have to tell you.

00:13:38.517 --> 00:13:40.419
-Can we eat our bread, already?
-Oh, yeah.

00:13:40.419 --> 00:13:42.387
We're done with dinner.
-Oh, we're done?

00:13:42.387 --> 00:13:44.056
-We're finished with dinner.
Yes, it's the end.

00:13:44.056 --> 00:13:45.624
-Yes, I said that earlier.
-Check, please.

00:13:45.624 --> 00:13:48.927
I'm getting the check,
but it's going well.

00:13:48.927 --> 00:13:50.996
I have something to tell you.

00:13:50.996 --> 00:13:53.131
-Okay. God, I'm nervous.
What is it?

00:13:53.131 --> 00:13:55.634
-Okay. [ Clears throat ]

00:13:55.634 --> 00:13:57.636
[ Sighs ]
Here goes nothing.

00:13:57.636 --> 00:14:00.272
[ Chuckles ]
-Yeah?

00:14:00.272 --> 00:14:03.275
-I live with 52
untrustworthy rhinos.

00:14:03.275 --> 00:14:05.143
[ Laughter ]

00:14:05.143 --> 00:14:07.112
-Oh, [Bleep].

00:14:07.112 --> 00:14:10.048
[ Laughter ]
Aw, dagnabbit.

00:14:10.048 --> 00:14:12.984
-I -- I understand
your reaction.

00:14:12.984 --> 00:14:14.919
A lot of people
respond that way.

00:14:14.919 --> 00:14:17.656
-No, no, I'm just I'm just glad
you're being honest.

00:14:17.656 --> 00:14:20.859
You know, I really like you,
Popeye.

00:14:20.859 --> 00:14:22.361
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:14:22.361 --> 00:14:24.730
-It's not just 'cause
you have nice ears.

00:14:24.730 --> 00:14:26.665
[ Laughter ]

00:14:26.665 --> 00:14:29.735
-This feels right.
-Yeah.

00:14:29.735 --> 00:14:31.569
Hey, listen, Valentine's Day
is almost here.

00:14:31.569 --> 00:14:35.341
Do you mind if I -- if I recite
my favorite Valentine's poem?

00:14:35.341 --> 00:14:37.809
-Oh, my goodness.
I'd love to hear you, yeah.

00:14:37.809 --> 00:14:40.178
-Thank you. Okay.
-Are you gonna stand up?

00:14:40.178 --> 00:14:41.947
-I'm gonna stand up
and face you.

00:14:41.947 --> 00:14:43.582
I hope the other diners
don't mind.

00:14:43.582 --> 00:14:45.650
-I'm happy there's no one else
at the restaurant.

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:47.786
Picked the greatest --
[ Laughter ]

00:14:47.786 --> 00:14:49.821
I don't know how we got
a reservation here, yeah.

00:14:49.821 --> 00:14:51.924
-Um...
-Oh, yeah, so, the...

00:14:51.924 --> 00:14:54.159
-Okay.
[ Soft music plays ]

00:14:54.159 --> 00:14:57.196
"Roses are flashy,

00:14:57.196 --> 00:15:00.332
violets are spies,

00:15:00.332 --> 00:15:03.101
deodorant is sweet,

00:15:03.101 --> 00:15:04.837
and so are eyes."

00:15:04.837 --> 00:15:06.871
[ Laughter ]
-That is beautiful!

00:15:06.871 --> 00:15:10.376
[ Cheers and applause ]
And scene. Here we go.

